@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About Us | Sparc Cooperative</PageTitle>

<section>
    <header>
        <h1>About Us</h1>
    </header>

    <article>
        <img src="/img/LogoMosaic.png" alt="Sparc Cooperative" />
        <p>
            Sparc is a co–op startup platform built for a new kind of founder: the kind who believes in building with people, not just for them.
        </p>
        <p>
            We're reimagining what it means to start and grow a company. In a world where ownership is too often reserved for the few at the top, Sparc flips the script. We believe the people who contribute to the company, whether they're founders, employees, or supporters, deserve a stake in its success.
        </p>
        <p>
            That's why we created Sparc. So startups have a place to grow collaboratively, with shared ownership baked in from day one.
        </p>
        <p>
            Whether you're a solo founder with a big idea, or a team ready to build something that lasts, Sparc gives you the tools, support, and structure to grow, without giving up control. You don't have to do this alone. We're a community, a collective, a co–op. When one of us wins, we all do.
        </p>
        <p>
            Together we're building a future where startups are more equitable, more human and more powerful, because they're powered by everyone.
        </p>
        <p>
            Let's build what's next. Together.
        </p>
    </article>
</section>
